Reason: endian: the HUD (game_6) and pause map (guide) archives are swapped into one buffer from ARAM; convert every file after each remount, since screens keep pointers into the buffer
--- a/src/System/Application.cpp
+++ b/src/System/Application.cpp
@@ -179,6 +179,15 @@
 		                       EXPAND_SWITCH_DEFAULT, 0, nullptr, -1, nullptr);
